Day 19 – Area 📐

Today I practiced Area problems in Aptitude.

Topics Covered

- Area of Square
- Area of Rectangle
- Area of Triangle
- Area of Circle
- Area of Parallelogram
- Area of Trapezium
- Area of Rhombus
- Area-based word problems

Important Formulas

Square:
Area = side²

Rectangle:
Area = Length × Breadth

Triangle:
Area = ½ × Base × Height

Circle:
Area = πr²

Parallelogram:
Area = Base × Height

Trapezium:
Area = ½ × (Sum of parallel sides) × Height

Rhombus:
Area = ½ × d₁ × d₂
